# Build context hygiene: keep Windows-built .NET output, node_modules and local
# secrets out of the image. bin/obj especially - copying host build artifacts
# into the Linux build breaks or silently staleness-poisons `dotnet publish`.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
.git/
.gitignore
apps/
hardware/
supabase/
docs/
# Showcase videos, renders and the slide deck (~450 MB); the image needs none of it.
showcase/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.h
